<title>USA: Office Depot names Macatee president/COO.</title>
<headline>Office Depot names Macatee president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>DELRAY BEACH, Fla. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Office Depot Inc on Monday named John Macatee, formerly of Sherwin Williams Paint Stores Group, as president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>A spokesman was not immediately available to say who Macatee replaces.</p>
<p>Office Depot also named Thomas Kroeger, another former Sherwin Williams employee, as executive vice president of human resources. Kroeger replaces Terry Bean, who became senior vice president of the company's commercial business unit.</p>
